# Shared archive, phase 2 of 3: archived on the runner, as a desktop Soma archives it (POST /threads/ID/archive). The
# Fold's own engine hears it at its next look (foreground poll, 30 s at most): the tab leaves its strip, and its All chats
# says archived, cover and unfolded alike.
wait 35000
absent Walk shared
# Look: the cover's strip no longer has "Walk shared".
shot cover-gone
tap All chats
expect archived
# Look: All chats over the cover: "Walk shared" with its "archived" tag.
shot cover-all-chats-archived
key BACK
fold unfolded
wait 2000
absent Walk shared
tap All chats
expect archived
# Look: unfolded, All chats beside the chat: "Walk shared" archived; its tab is not in the strip.
shot unfolded-all-chats-archived
key BACK
